   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="letter">
                <div type="address">
                    <ab>
                        <address>
                            <addrLine>
                                <name type="geo" key="G_ITA_TRIE_13">via Sanità, 2, </name>
                            </addrLine>
                            <addrLine>
                                <name type="geo" key="G_ITA_TRIE">Trieste.</name> </addrLine>
                        </address>
                    </ab>
                </div>
                <div type="mainBody">
                    <p>Caro <name type="person" key="rugg87">Ruggiero</name>: Mille ringraziamenti del gentile ricordo del mio compleanno. Non è stato però come <seg xml:id="seg1" type="note-anchor">l’ultimo da noi</seg>. Ahimè! Spero di rivederla presto – o qui o là. Lavoro a stento. Ma scrivo sempre.</p>        	<closer>
                        <salute>Una cordiale stretta di mano</salute>                    	<signed>
                            <name type="person" key="joyc82">James Joyce</name>
                        </signed> <date when="1920-02-13">13/2/920</date>
                    </closer>
                </div>
                <div type="translation">
                    <p>Dear Ruggiero: A thousand thanks for kindly remembering my birthday. It was not, however, like the last one at our place. Alas! I hope to see you soon – either here or there. I have difficulty working. But I’m always writing. </p>
                    <closer>
                        <salute>A cordial handshake </salute>
                        <signed>James Joyce </signed> <date when="1920-02-13">13/2/920</date>
                    </closer>
                </div>
            </div> ​​<div type="notes">
                <note xml:id="note1" target="#seg1" type="commentary">According to Frank Budgen, Ruggiero “was invaluable on Joyce’s birthday night (a great event in the Joycean household) for the preparation of middle eastern exotic dishes”. JJ must be remembering his birthday celebration in 1919 (<name type="work" key="ID_MISSING">JJJMU</name>, 174).</note>
            </div> 
      </body>
   </text>
